    "details": "phpMyFAQ team reports:\n\n> The WebAuthn prepare-login endpoint returns stable credential IDs for\n> existing accounts with registered passkeys and rotating credential IDs\n> for unknown accounts, so an unauthenticated attacker can enumerate\n> user accounts and passkeys.\n>\n> Insufficient authorization checks allow a delegated group\n> administrator to delete groups with higher privileges than their own.\n",
